title: Hebrews 6 – The First Principles
description: The six foundation stones of Hebrews 6:1-2, the milk every babe in Christ knows, and how these first principles try the spirits and expose those who subvert the faith.
output: lessons/bible/hebrews-6-first-principles.html

# From the author's outline (November 2026), in the author's words, arranged into slides.
# The verses are shown from the KJV. Fixed: "I to Christ" -> "into Christ". The outline's six blocks follow Hebrews 6:1-2.

=== The first principles
--- Hebrews 6 [title]
overline: Bible lessons
heading: The First Principles
sub: The 6 foundational blocks of Hebrews 6, the milk that babes in Christ know
hint: Use the arrow keys or swipe to move through the slides. Tap any gold reference to read the verse.

--- Milk, and not strong meat
kicker: [[Hebrews 5:12-14]]
scripture: Hebrews 5:12-14 | mark: the first principles of the oracles of God; he is a babe

--- Let us go on unto perfection
kicker: [[Hebrews 6:1-3]]
scripture: Hebrews 6:1-3 | mark: not laying again the foundation

--- The gospel by which you are saved
lead: Part of being a saved believer is knowing these basic doctrines, because they are the gospel by which you are saved.
p: That foundational knowledge is the understanding with which we first trusted, milk to babes.

=== The 6 foundational blocks
--- The 6 Foundational Blocks
point: Repentance from Dead Works | Turning away from self-righteousness, religion, and human effort to save oneself.
point: Faith Toward God | Placing absolute trust in the finished work of Jesus Christ alone.
point: Doctrine of Baptisms | Understanding spiritual baptism (into Christ by the Spirit) and the subsequent water ordinance as a public testimony to join the local church.
point: Laying on of Hands | The order and structure of the local church in setting apart qualified men for ministry.
point: Resurrection of the Dead | The literal, bodily resurrection of believers to eternal life.
point: Eternal Judgment | The absolute reality of a final reckoning, the lake of fire for the lost, and the escape from hell for the saved.

--- 1. Repentance from Dead Works
kicker: The 6 Foundational Blocks
lead: Turning away from self-righteousness, religion, and human effort to save oneself.
refs: Hebrews 9:14; Titus 3:5; Ephesians 2:8-9

--- 2. Faith Toward God
kicker: The 6 Foundational Blocks
lead: Placing absolute trust in the finished work of Jesus Christ alone.
refs: John 19:30; Romans 4:5; Hebrews 11:6

--- 3. Doctrine of Baptisms
kicker: The 6 Foundational Blocks
lead: Understanding spiritual baptism (into Christ by the Spirit) and the subsequent water ordinance as a public testimony to join the local church.
panel: Into Christ, by the Spirit | [[1 Corinthians 12:13]] · [[Galatians 3:27]]
panel: The water ordinance | [[Acts 2:41]] · [[Acts 8:36-38]]

--- 4. Laying on of Hands
kicker: The 6 Foundational Blocks
lead: The order and structure of the local church in setting apart qualified men for ministry.
refs: Acts 6:6; Acts 13:3; 1 Timothy 4:14; 1 Timothy 5:22

--- 5. Resurrection of the Dead
kicker: The 6 Foundational Blocks
lead: The literal, bodily resurrection of believers to eternal life.
refs: John 5:28-29; 1 Corinthians 15:52; 1 Thessalonians 4:16

--- 6. Eternal Judgment
kicker: The 6 Foundational Blocks
lead: The absolute reality of a final reckoning, the lake of fire for the lost, and the escape from hell for the saved.
refs: Hebrews 9:27; Revelation 20:15; Romans 8:1

--- Milk to babes
p: Repentance from dead works, and faith towards God.
p: Baptisms, into Christ, of the Spirit, of the water ordinance to join a local church.
p: The laying on of hands for those who choose to serve in the ministry.
p: The understanding of the future resurrection, eternal life and escape from judgment, death and hell.

--- The bare minimum [title]
heading: The bare minimum
center: Knowledge of these things and faith above all, and for all, is bare minimum.
p: And these fundamental truths are also the surest way to test those who claim to be teachers, and who through vain words subvert the faith.

=== Trying the spirits
--- Ye are of God, little children
kicker: [[1 John 4:4-6]]
scripture: 1 John 4:4-6 | mark: greater is he that is in you, than he that is in the world; Hereby know we the spirit of truth, and the spirit of error

--- Even babes
lead: Even babes are able to exercise discernment, and come to maturity through trying the spirits to see if men are from God or not.
big: 1 John 4:1 | mark: try the spirits whether they are of God

--- By the gospel
lead: It is by the gospel that we can identify those who teach vain jangling to itching ears.
refs: 1 Timothy 1:6; 2 Timothy 4:3; Titus 1:10-11

--- Made merchandise of
p: Ironically, it is often longtime Christian believers who get fooled by these men, not losing their salvation, but never moving on to the meat of the word, and so being manipulated to be made merchandise of out of laziness and pride.
refs: 2 Peter 2:3; 1 Corinthians 8:1

--- A litmus test [title]
heading: A litmus test
center: Sometimes it is a babe in Christ who has the good news fresh before them, that resists these tempters, when others follow after them, puffed up by a little knowledge and not much else.
take: These truths act as a litmus test.
